<title>USA: Delaware $80 mln GOs won by Merrill at 4.964 pct.</title>
<headline>Delaware $80 mln GOs won by Merrill at 4.964 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Tuesday it won $80 million Delaware general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 4.964 percent.</p>
